@api = http://127.0.0.1:5173

### Sign in through the BFF in the browser first. Prefer /swagger on this same origin.
### An HTTP client needs its own authenticated cookie jar and the csrfToken from GET /bff/session.
POST {{api}}/api/users
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.user@example.com",
  "firstName": "New",
  "lastName": "User",
  "temporaryPassword": "{{temporary_password}}"
}
